Java Version Manager (https://github.com/Jabba-Team/jabba) - Shimmed

Usage: jabba [OPTIONS] [COMMAND]

Commands:
  alias      Resolve or update an alias
  current    Display currently 'use'ed version
  install    Download and install JDK
  link       Resolve or update a link
  ls         List installed versions
  ls-alias   List configured aliases
  ls-remote  List remote versiosn available for install
  unalias    Delete an alias
  uninstall  Uninstall JDK
  unlink     Delete a link
  use        Modify the `current` alias to use specific JDK
  which      Display path to installed JDK
  help       Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -V, --version...
          Show version of jabba
          
          Run with -vV to show the version for jabba-shim as well

  -v, --verbose...
          Verbose. More -v makes it more verbose (opposite of --quiet)

  -q, --quiet...
          Quiet. More -q makes it more quiet (opposite of --verbose)

      --color <COLOR>
          Set the color mode for this program. May affect subprocesses spawned
          
          [possible values: always, never, auto]

  -h, --help
          Print help (see a summary with '-h')
